      "side": 1,
      "message": "Myles, this patch adds definition of the HCI event \"Authenticated Payload Timeout Expired\" to the tool hcidoc to identify the potential problems of a new BT controller. I treat it as an invalid invalid in hci_layer.cc to avoid its impact on Bluetooth host. \n\nHere\u0027s how I verify it with bluetooth_test_gd_unit. Please let me know if anything else is needed?\n```\nsource build/envsetup.sh\nlunch aosp_cf_x86_64_phone-userdebug\nm -j\natest --host bluetooth_test_gd_unit\n```",
      "revId": "bf6031dd7e4da0548f62b531849d0f05e01d9b9c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
